    <contentBlocks>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000001",
      "key": "1a6ae5b7-9db2-4057-abdc-90b6f5958268",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "html",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At its heart, Centro Forge empowers Centroees with stronger communication skills and greater confidence — equipping them to engage clients more effectively, express ideas with clarity, and represent Centro at the highest levels. But this program is more than a training course. It’s a step forward in shaping the way we grow, operate, and lead in a global marketplace.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Strong communication isn’t a soft skill. It’s a hard advantage. And Centro Forge is built to deliver it.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Equipping Teams for Global-Grade CX</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Centro Forge doesn’t just teach English. It fosters strategic thinking. It creates space for professionals to better understand how to speak the language of the business world — fluently, confidently, and insightfully. This foundation allows our people to participate in high-level conversations about the future of CX: AI integration, omnichannel support, and customer success as a driver of loyalty and growth.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is especially powerful in an era where thought leadership has a real impact on business decisions. Studies show that 75% of decision-makers are more likely to trust a company based on its thought leadership than traditional marketing. In fact, compelling thought leadership often leads them to consider providers they hadn’t previously considered. Centro Forge puts our people in a position to lead those conversations — and help open the door to new opportunities.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A Culture of Growth and Belonging</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Just as importantly, Centro Forge embodies one of our core values: <strong>Helping People Develop</strong>. It sends a powerful message to current and future Centroees — that this is a place where growth is not only encouraged but actively supported.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether it’s a team member gaining confidence in professional communication or a leader refining their ability to connect with global clients, the impact of this initiative is deeply personal. It’s about creating a culture of continuous learning. One where curiosity is nurtured, talent is developed, and everyone feels like they’re part of a community that wants them to succeed.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Forging a Future of Fluent Leaders</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Centro Forge is just the beginning of that alignment. It’s where internal development meets external influence. Where people grow, and the business grows with them. And where language becomes a bridge — to opportunity, to impact, and to the future of Centro.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We’re proud to have launched Centro Forge. But we’re even more excited about what it will create.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The future speaks clearly — and so will we."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
