    </category>
    <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[In today’s competitive BPO and CX landscape, it’s not just what you offer — it’s how confidently and clearly your team communicates it. That’s why we’re proud to officially launch Centro Forge: our in-house English training initiative designed to unlock the full potential of our people while amplifying Centro’s strategic presence on the global stage.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
